  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Duo Control is a premium hybrid set combining NXT Control 16 / 1.32 mm with Luxilon 4G Rough 17 / 1.25 mm. NXT Control contributes comfort, pocketing and shock absorption, while the textured 4G Rough co-poly adds spin, precision, stability and exceptional tension maintenance. Wilson allows either string to be installed in the mains, enabling players to tune the hybrid toward firmer control or greater comfort. For ideal playability, Wilson recommends reducing the tension of Luxilon 4G Rough by at least 10%.",

    "zh": "Wilson Duo Control 是一套由 NXT Control 16 / 1.32 毫米与 Luxilon 4G Rough 17 / 1.25 毫米组成的官方 Hybrid。NXT Control 负责提供舒适、Pocketing、触球感和减震，而纹理型 4G Rough 聚酯则负责 Spin、Precision、稳定性以及非常优秀的保磅表现。两根球线都可以作为主线使用：4G Rough 做主线时整体更偏控制和旋转；NXT Control 做主线时则更加舒适、柔和并具有更好的 Pocketing。Wilson 特别建议，为获得理想可打性，Luxilon 4G Rough 的穿线磅数至少降低 10%。"
  },

